:STEP:9
:PATTERN-MATCH:100
:STEP:10
:CMD: show node R3 ip vrf 0 route 0
:STEP:11
:PATTERN-MATCH:201.0.0.0/24
:STEP:12
:GREP:201.0.0.0/24
:STEP:13
:PATTERN-MATCH:200
:STEP:14
:CMD: show node R3 ip vrf 0 route 0
:STEP:15
:PATTERN-MATCH:202.0.0.0/24
:STEP:16
:GREP:202.0.0.0/24
:STEP:17
:PATTERN-MATCH:150
:STEP:18
:CMD: show node R3 ip vrf 0 route 0
:STEP:19
:PATTERN-MATCH:203.0.0.0/24
:STEP:20
:GREP:203.0.0.0/24
:STEP:21
:PATTERN-MATCH:180
:STEP:22
:CMD: show node R3 ip vrf 0 route 0
:STEP:23
:PATTERN-MATCH:50.1.1.1
:STEP:24
:PATTERN-MATCH:eth9

Delete BGP routes
:STEP:25
:CMD: config node R3 no rtm-route prefix 200.0.0.0/24 3 6 0 2 100 gateway 50.1.1.1 interface eth9
:STEP:26
:CMD: config node R3 no rtm-route prefix 201.0.0.0/24 3 7 0 2 200 gateway 50.1.1.1 interface eth9
:STEP:27
:CMD: config node R3 no rtm-route prefix 202.0.0.0/24 3 8 0 2 150 gateway 50.1.1.1 interface eth9
:STEP:28
:CMD: config node R3 no rtm-route prefix 203.0.0.0/24 3 9 0 2 180 gateway 50.1.1.1 interface eth9


Verify all BGP routes are deleted
:STEP:29
:CMD: show node R3 ip vrf 0 route 0
:STEP:30
:PATTERN-NOT-MATCH:200.0.0.0/24
:STEP:31
:PATTERN-NOT-MATCH:201.0.0.0/24
:STEP:32
:PATTERN-NOT-MATCH:202.0.0.0/24
:STEP:33
:PATTERN-NOT-MATCH:203.0.0.0/24

:TESTCASE-END:4


:TESTCASE-BEGIN:5
