:TESTCASE-BEGIN:6
:DESC: Test case to test RTM Routes with MPLS Label Stack

:PRINT: Testing Routes with MPLS Label Stack Operations

Add route with single MPLS label on R5
:STEP:1
:CMD: config node R5 rtm-route prefix 150.0.0.0/24 0 0 0 2 10 gateway 30.1.1.1 interface eth5 label-stack 100


Verify route with label
:STEP:2
:CMD: show node R5 ip vrf 0 route 0
:STEP:3
:PATTERN-MATCH:150.0.0.0/24
:STEP:4
:GREP:150.0.0.0/24
:STEP:5
:PATTERN-MATCH:100

Add route with multiple MPLS labels (label stack)
:STEP:6
:CMD: config node R5 rtm-route prefix 151.0.0.0/24 0 0 0 2 10 gateway 30.1.1.1 interface eth5 label-stack 200 300 400


Verify route with label stack
:STEP:7
:CMD: show node R5 ip vrf 0 route 0
:STEP:8
:PATTERN-MATCH:151.0.0.0/24
:STEP:9
:GREP:151.0.0.0/24
:STEP:10
:PATTERN-MATCH:200
:STEP:11
:PATTERN-MATCH:300
:STEP:12
:PATTERN-MATCH:400

Add LDP route with label
:STEP:13
:CMD: config node R5 rtm-route prefix 152.0.0.0/24 8 0 0 2 10 gateway 30.1.1.1 interface eth5 label-stack 500


Add SR route with label stack
:STEP:14
:CMD: config node R5 rtm-route prefix 153.0.0.0/24 6 0 0 2 10 gateway 30.1.1.1 interface eth5 label-stack 16001 16002 16003


Verify all labeled routes
:STEP:15
:CMD: show node R5 ip vrf 0 route 0
:STEP:16
:PATTERN-MATCH:152.0.0.0/24
:STEP:17
:PATTERN-MATCH:LDP
:STEP:18
:GREP:152.0.0.0/24
:STEP:19
:PATTERN-MATCH:500
:STEP:20
:CMD: show node R5 ip vrf 0 route 0
:STEP:21
:PATTERN-MATCH:153.0.0.0/24
:STEP:22
:PATTERN-MATCH:SR
:STEP:23
:GREP:153.0.0.0/24
:STEP:24
:PATTERN-MATCH:16001
:STEP:25
:PATTERN-MATCH:16002
:STEP:26
:PATTERN-MATCH:16003

Delete labeled routes
:STEP:27
:CMD: config node R5 no rtm-route prefix 150.0.0.0/24 0 0 0 2 10 gateway 30.1.1.1 interface eth5 label-stack 100
:STEP:28
:CMD: config node R5 no rtm-route prefix 151.0.0.0/24 0 0 0 2 10 gateway 30.1.1.1 interface eth5 label-stack 200 300 400
:STEP:29
:CMD: config node R5 no rtm-route prefix 152.0.0.0/24 8 0 0 2 10 gateway 30.1.1.1 interface eth5 label-stack 500
:STEP:30
:CMD: config node R5 no rtm-route prefix 153.0.0.0/24 6 0 0 2 10 gateway 30.1.1.1 interface eth5 label-stack 16001 16002 16003


Verify all labeled routes are deleted
:STEP:31
:CMD: show node R5 ip vrf 0 route 0
:STEP:32
:PATTERN-NOT-MATCH:150.0.0.0/24
:STEP:33
:PATTERN-NOT-MATCH:151.0.0.0/24
:STEP:34
:PATTERN-NOT-MATCH:152.0.0.0/24
:STEP:35
:PATTERN-NOT-MATCH:153.0.0.0/24

:TESTCASE-END:6


:TESTCASE-BEGIN:7
:DESC: Test case to test RTM Route Updates and Metric Changes

:PRINT: Testing Route Update Scenarios

Add initial route with metric 10
:STEP:1
:CMD: config node R0 rtm-route prefix 10.20.30.0/24 0 0 0 2 10 gateway 10.1.1.2 interface eth0


Verify initial route with metric 10
:STEP:2
:CMD: show node R0 ip vrf 0 route 0
:STEP:3
:PATTERN-MATCH:10.20.30.0/24
:STEP:4
:GREP:10.20.30.0/24
:STEP:5
:PATTERN-MATCH:10.1.1.2
:STEP:6
:PATTERN-MATCH:eth0

Add same route with different metric (route update)
:STEP:7
:CMD: config node R0 rtm-route prefix 10.20.30.0/24 0 0 0 2 50 gateway 10.1.1.2 interface eth0


Verify route now has two nexthops with different metrics
:STEP:8
:CMD: show node R0 ip vrf 0 route 0
:STEP:9
:PATTERN-MATCH:10.20.30.0/24
:STEP:10
:PATTERN-MATCH:10.1.1.2

Add same route with different gateway (route change)
:STEP:11
:CMD: config node R0 rtm-route prefix 10.20.30.0/24 0 0 0 2 50 gateway 80.1.1.2 interface eth14


Verify route with new gateway exists
:STEP:12
:CMD: show node R0 ip vrf 0 route 0
:STEP:13
:PATTERN-MATCH:10.20.30.0/24
:STEP:14
:PATTERN-MATCH:80.1.1.2
:STEP:15
:PATTERN-MATCH:eth14

Delete all versions
:STEP:16
:CMD: config node R0 no rtm-route prefix 10.20.30.0/24 0 0 0 2 10 gateway 10.1.1.2 interface eth0
:STEP:17
:CMD: config node R0 no rtm-route prefix 10.20.30.0/24 0 0 0 2 50 gateway 10.1.1.2 interface eth0
:STEP:18
:CMD: config node R0 no rtm-route prefix 10.20.30.0/24 0 0 0 2 50 gateway 80.1.1.2 interface eth14


Verify route is completely deleted
:STEP:19
:CMD: show node R0 ip vrf 0 route 0
:STEP:20
:PATTERN-NOT-MATCH:10.20.30.0/24

:TESTCASE-END:7


:TESTCASE-BEGIN:8
:DESC: Test case to test RTM with Different Prefix Lengths

:PRINT: Testing Routes with Various Prefix Lengths (Specificity)

Add /32 host route
:STEP:1
:CMD: config node R1 rtm-route prefix 1.1.1.1/32 0 0 0 2 10 gateway 10.1.1.1 interface eth1


Add /24 network route
:STEP:2
:CMD: config node R1 rtm-route prefix 1.1.1.0/24 0 0 0 2 10 gateway 10.1.1.1 interface eth1


Add /16 network route
:STEP:3
:CMD: config node R1 rtm-route prefix 1.1.0.0/16 0 0 0 2 10 gateway 10.1.1.1 interface eth1


Add /8 network route
:STEP:4
:CMD: config node R1 rtm-route prefix 1.0.0.0/8 0 0 0 2 10 gateway 10.1.1.1 interface eth1


Add default route /0
:STEP:5
:CMD: config node R1 rtm-route prefix 0.0.0.0/0 0 0 0 2 10 gateway 10.1.1.1 interface eth1


Verify all prefix lengths with gateway and interface
:STEP:6
:CMD: show node R1 ip vrf 0 route 0
:STEP:7
:PATTERN-MATCH:1.1.1.1/32
:STEP:8
:PATTERN-MATCH:1.1.1.0/24
:STEP:9
:PATTERN-MATCH:1.1.0.0/16
:STEP:10
:PATTERN-MATCH:1.0.0.0/8
:STEP:11
:PATTERN-MATCH:0.0.0.0/0
:STEP:12
:PATTERN-MATCH:10.1.1.1
:STEP:13
:PATTERN-MATCH:eth1

Delete all prefix length routes
:STEP:14
:CMD: config node R1 no rtm-route prefix 1.1.1.1/32 0 0 0 2 10 gateway 10.1.1.1 interface eth1
:STEP:15
:CMD: config node R1 no rtm-route prefix 1.1.1.0/24 0 0 0 2 10 gateway 10.1.1.1 interface eth1
:STEP:16
:CMD: config node R1 no rtm-route prefix 1.1.0.0/16 0 0 0 2 10 gateway 10.1.1.1 interface eth1
:STEP:17
:CMD: config node R1 no rtm-route prefix 1.0.0.0/8 0 0 0 2 10 gateway 10.1.1.1 interface eth1
:STEP:18
:CMD: config node R1 no rtm-route prefix 0.0.0.0/0 0 0 0 2 10 gateway 10.1.1.1 interface eth1


Verify all routes are deleted
:STEP:19
:CMD: show node R1 ip vrf 0 route 0
:STEP:20
:PATTERN-NOT-MATCH:1.1.1.1/32
:STEP:21
:PATTERN-NOT-MATCH:1.1.1.0/24
:STEP:22
:PATTERN-NOT-MATCH:1.1.0.0/16
:STEP:23
:PATTERN-NOT-MATCH:1.0.0.0/8

:TESTCASE-END:8


:TESTCASE-BEGIN:9
:DESC: Test case to test RTM with Multiple Protocols for Same Prefix

:PRINT: Testing Route Preference - Same Prefix from Different Protocols

Add Static route (AD=1)
:STEP:1
:CMD: config node R2 rtm-route prefix 5.5.5.0/24 0 0 0 2 10 gateway 20.1.1.1 interface eth3


Verify static route is installed
:STEP:2
:CMD: show node R2 ip vrf 0 route 0
:STEP:3
:PATTERN-MATCH:5.5.5.0/24
:STEP:4
:PATTERN-MATCH:Static

Add BGP External route (AD=20) - should coexist with static
:STEP:5
:CMD: config node R2 rtm-route prefix 5.5.5.0/24 3 7 0 2 100 gateway 20.1.1.1 interface eth3


Verify both static and BGP routes exist
:STEP:6
:CMD: show node R2 ip vrf 0 route 0
:STEP:7
:PATTERN-MATCH:5.5.5.0/24
:STEP:8
:PATTERN-MATCH:BGP

Add ISIS route (AD=115) - less preferred
:STEP:9
:CMD: config node R2 rtm-route prefix 5.5.5.0/24 4 2 0 2 50 gateway 20.1.1.1 interface eth3


Add OSPF route (AD=110) - between BGP and ISIS
:STEP:10
:CMD: config node R2 rtm-route prefix 5.5.5.0/24 5 11 0 2 20 gateway 20.1.1.1 interface eth3


Verify all protocol routes exist for same prefix
:STEP:11
:CMD: show node R2 ip vrf 0 route 0
:STEP:12
:PATTERN-MATCH:5.5.5.0/24
:STEP:13
:PATTERN-MATCH:ISIS
:STEP:14
:CMD: show node R2 ip vrf 0 route 0
:STEP:15
:PATTERN-MATCH:OSPF

Delete routes one by one and verify
:STEP:16
:CMD: config node R2 no rtm-route prefix 5.5.5.0/24 0 0 0 2 10 gateway 20.1.1.1 interface eth3
:STEP:17
:CMD: show node R2 ip vrf 0 route 0
:STEP:18
:PATTERN-MATCH:5.5.5.0/24
:STEP:19
:CMD: config node R2 no rtm-route prefix 5.5.5.0/24 3 7 0 2 100 gateway 20.1.1.1 interface eth3
:STEP:20
:CMD: config node R2 no rtm-route prefix 5.5.5.0/24 4 2 0 2 50 gateway 20.1.1.1 interface eth3
:STEP:21
:CMD: config node R2 no rtm-route prefix 5.5.5.0/24 5 11 0 2 20 gateway 20.1.1.1 interface eth3


Verify all routes for this prefix are deleted
:STEP:22
:CMD: show node R2 ip vrf 0 route 0
:STEP:23
:PATTERN-NOT-MATCH:5.5.5.0/24

:TESTCASE-END:9


:TESTCASE-BEGIN:10
:DESC: Test case to test RTM SR and LFA Routes

:PRINT: Testing Segment Routing (SR) and Loop-Free Alternate (LFA) Routes

Add Segment Routing route on R3
:STEP:1
:CMD: config node R3 rtm-route prefix 160.0.0.0/24 6 0 0 2 10 gateway 50.1.1.1 interface eth9 label-stack 16010 16020 16030


Verify SR route with label stack
:STEP:2
:CMD: show node R3 ip vrf 0 route 0
:STEP:3
:PATTERN-MATCH:160.0.0.0/24
:STEP:4
:PATTERN-MATCH:SR
:STEP:5
:GREP:160.0.0.0/24
:STEP:6
:PATTERN-MATCH:16010
:STEP:7
:PATTERN-MATCH:16020
:STEP:8
:PATTERN-MATCH:16030

Add LFA backup route on R3
:STEP:9
:CMD: config node R3 rtm-route prefix 161.0.0.0/24 7 0 0 2 15 gateway 50.1.1.1 interface eth9


Verify LFA route
:STEP:10
:CMD: show node R3 ip vrf 0 route 0
:STEP:11
:PATTERN-MATCH:161.0.0.0/24
:STEP:12
:PATTERN-MATCH:LFA

Add SR-TE (Segment Routing Traffic Engineering) route
:STEP:13
:CMD: config node R3 rtm-route prefix 162.0.0.0/24 9 0 0 2 20 gateway 50.1.1.1 interface eth9 label-stack 17001 17002


Verify SR-TE route with labels
:STEP:14
:CMD: show node R3 ip vrf 0 route 0
:STEP:15
:PATTERN-MATCH:162.0.0.0/24
:STEP:16
:PATTERN-MATCH:SR-TE
:STEP:17
:GREP:162.0.0.0/24
:STEP:18
:PATTERN-MATCH:17001
:STEP:19
:PATTERN-MATCH:17002

Delete SR and LFA routes
:STEP:20
:CMD: config node R3 no rtm-route prefix 160.0.0.0/24 6 0 0 2 10 gateway 50.1.1.1 interface eth9 label-stack 16010 16020 16030
:STEP:21
:CMD: config node R3 no rtm-route prefix 161.0.0.0/24 7 0 0 2 15 gateway 50.1.1.1 interface eth9
:STEP:22
:CMD: config node R3 no rtm-route prefix 162.0.0.0/24 9 0 0 2 20 gateway 50.1.1.1 interface eth9 label-stack 17001 17002


Verify all SR and LFA routes are deleted
:STEP:23
:CMD: show node R3 ip vrf 0 route 0
:STEP:24
:PATTERN-NOT-MATCH:160.0.0.0/24
:STEP:25
:PATTERN-NOT-MATCH:161.0.0.0/24
:STEP:26
:PATTERN-NOT-MATCH:162.0.0.0/24

:TESTCASE-END:10


