:PATTERN-NOT-MATCH:181.0.0.0/24
:STEP:26
:PATTERN-NOT-MATCH:182.0.0.0/24
:STEP:27
:PATTERN-NOT-MATCH:183.0.0.0/24

:TESTCASE-END:12


:TESTCASE-BEGIN:13
:DESC: Test case to test RTM Edge Cases and Boundary Conditions

:PRINT: Testing Edge Cases and Boundary Conditions

Add maximum prefix length /32
:STEP:1
:CMD: config node R0 rtm-route prefix 255.255.255.255/32 0 0 0 2 10 gateway 10.1.1.2 interface eth0


Add minimum prefix length /0 (default route)
:STEP:2
:CMD: config node R0 rtm-route prefix 0.0.0.0/0 0 0 0 2 100 gateway 10.1.1.2 interface eth0


Add route with very high metric
:STEP:3
:CMD: config node R0 rtm-route prefix 190.0.0.0/24 0 0 0 2 65000 gateway 10.1.1.2 interface eth0


Add route with minimum metric
:STEP:4
:CMD: config node R0 rtm-route prefix 191.0.0.0/24 0 0 0 2 1 gateway 10.1.1.2 interface eth0


Verify all edge case routes with metrics
:STEP:5
:CMD: show node R0 ip vrf 0 route 0
:STEP:6
:PATTERN-MATCH:255.255.255.255/32
:STEP:7
:GREP:255.255.255.255/32
:STEP:8
:PATTERN-MATCH:10
:STEP:9
:CMD: show node R0 ip vrf 0 route 0
:STEP:10
:PATTERN-MATCH:0.0.0.0/0
:STEP:11
:GREP:0.0.0.0/0
:STEP:12
:PATTERN-MATCH:100
:STEP:13
:CMD: show node R0 ip vrf 0 route 0
:STEP:14
:PATTERN-MATCH:190.0.0.0/24
:STEP:15
:GREP:190.0.0.0/24
:STEP:16
:PATTERN-MATCH:65000
:STEP:17
:CMD: show node R0 ip vrf 0 route 0
:STEP:18
:PATTERN-MATCH:191.0.0.0/24
:STEP:19
:GREP:191.0.0.0/24
:STEP:20
:PATTERN-MATCH:1

Delete edge case routes
:STEP:21
:CMD: config node R0 no rtm-route prefix 255.255.255.255/32 0 0 0 2 10 gateway 10.1.1.2 interface eth0
:STEP:22
:CMD: config node R0 no rtm-route prefix 0.0.0.0/0 0 0 0 2 100 gateway 10.1.1.2 interface eth0
:STEP:23
:CMD: config node R0 no rtm-route prefix 190.0.0.0/24 0 0 0 2 65000 gateway 10.1.1.2 interface eth0
:STEP:24
:CMD: config node R0 no rtm-route prefix 191.0.0.0/24 0 0 0 2 1 gateway 10.1.1.2 interface eth0


Verify all edge case routes are deleted
:STEP:25
:CMD: show node R0 ip vrf 0 route 0
:STEP:26
:PATTERN-NOT-MATCH:255.255.255.255/32
:STEP:27
:PATTERN-NOT-MATCH:190.0.0.0/24
:STEP:28
:PATTERN-NOT-MATCH:191.0.0.0/24

:TESTCASE-END:13


:TESTCASE-BEGIN:14
:DESC: Test case to test RTM Mixed Protocol Scenario

:PRINT: Testing Complex Real-World Scenario with Mixed Protocols

Add baseline static routes
:STEP:1
:CMD: config node R1 rtm-route prefix 8.8.8.0/24 0 0 0 2 10 gateway 10.1.1.1 interface eth1
:STEP:2
:CMD: config node R1 rtm-route prefix 9.9.9.0/24 0 0 0 2 10 gateway 20.1.1.2 interface eth2


Add ISIS routes
:STEP:3
:CMD: config node R1 rtm-route prefix 8.8.8.0/24 4 2 0 2 50 gateway 10.1.1.1 interface eth1
:STEP:4
:CMD: config node R1 rtm-route prefix 9.9.9.0/24 4 3 0 2 60 gateway 20.1.1.2 interface eth2


Add BGP routes
:STEP:5
:CMD: config node R1 rtm-route prefix 7.7.7.0/24 3 7 0 2 100 gateway 10.1.1.1 interface eth1


Add OSPF routes
:STEP:6
:CMD: config node R1 rtm-route prefix 6.6.6.0/24 5 11 0 2 20 gateway 20.1.1.2 interface eth2


Add SR routes with labels
:STEP:7
:CMD: config node R1 rtm-route prefix 5.5.5.0/24 6 0 0 2 15 gateway 10.1.1.1 interface eth1 label-stack 20001 20002


Verify mixed protocol routes with their specific protocols
:STEP:8
:CMD: show node R1 ip vrf 0 route 0
:STEP:9
:PATTERN-MATCH:8.8.8.0/24
:STEP:10
:PATTERN-MATCH:Static
:STEP:11
:PATTERN-MATCH:ISIS
:STEP:12
:CMD: show node R1 ip vrf 0 route 0
:STEP:13
:PATTERN-MATCH:9.9.9.0/24
:STEP:14
:PATTERN-MATCH:7.7.7.0/24
:STEP:15
:PATTERN-MATCH:BGP
:STEP:16
:CMD: show node R1 ip vrf 0 route 0
:STEP:17
:PATTERN-MATCH:6.6.6.0/24
:STEP:18
:PATTERN-MATCH:OSPF
:STEP:19
:PATTERN-MATCH:5.5.5.0/24
:STEP:20
:PATTERN-MATCH:SR

Clean up all routes
:STEP:21
:CMD: config node R1 no rtm-route prefix 8.8.8.0/24 0 0 0 2 10 gateway 10.1.1.1 interface eth1
:STEP:22
:CMD: config node R1 no rtm-route prefix 9.9.9.0/24 0 0 0 2 10 gateway 20.1.1.2 interface eth2
:STEP:23
:CMD: config node R1 no rtm-route prefix 8.8.8.0/24 4 2 0 2 50 gateway 10.1.1.1 interface eth1
:STEP:24
:CMD: config node R1 no rtm-route prefix 9.9.9.0/24 4 3 0 2 60 gateway 20.1.1.2 interface eth2
:STEP:25
:CMD: config node R1 no rtm-route prefix 7.7.7.0/24 3 7 0 2 100 gateway 10.1.1.1 interface eth1
:STEP:26
:CMD: config node R1 no rtm-route prefix 6.6.6.0/24 5 11 0 2 20 gateway 20.1.1.2 interface eth2
:STEP:27
:CMD: config node R1 no rtm-route prefix 5.5.5.0/24 6 0 0 2 15 gateway 10.1.1.1 interface eth1 label-stack 20001 20002


Verify all mixed protocol routes are deleted
:STEP:28
:CMD: show node R1 ip vrf 0 route 0
:STEP:29
:PATTERN-NOT-MATCH:8.8.8.0/24
:STEP:30
:PATTERN-NOT-MATCH:9.9.9.0/24
:STEP:31
:PATTERN-NOT-MATCH:7.7.7.0/24
:STEP:32
:PATTERN-NOT-MATCH:6.6.6.0/24
:STEP:33
:PATTERN-NOT-MATCH:5.5.5.0/24

:TESTCASE-END:14


:TESTCASE-BEGIN:15
:DESC: Test case to test RTM Route Overlapping and Longest Prefix Match

:PRINT: Testing Overlapping Routes and Longest Prefix Match Behavior

Add supernet /16
:STEP:1
:CMD: config node R2 rtm-route prefix 192.168.0.0/16 0 0 0 2 10 gateway 20.1.1.1 interface eth3


Add subnet /24 within the supernet
:STEP:2
:CMD: config node R2 rtm-route prefix 192.168.1.0/24 0 0 0 2 20 gateway 30.1.1.1 interface eth4


Add more specific /28
:STEP:3
:CMD: config node R2 rtm-route prefix 192.168.1.0/28 0 0 0 2 30 gateway 40.1.1.1 interface eth7


Add host route /32
:STEP:4
:CMD: config node R2 rtm-route prefix 192.168.1.1/32 0 0 0 2 5 gateway 50.1.1.2 interface eth8


Verify all overlapping routes exist with correct gateways
:STEP:5
:CMD: show node R2 ip vrf 0 route 0
:STEP:6
:PATTERN-MATCH:192.168.0.0/16
:STEP:7
:PATTERN-MATCH:192.168.1.0/24
:STEP:8
:PATTERN-MATCH:192.168.1.0/28
:STEP:9
:PATTERN-MATCH:192.168.1.1/32
:STEP:10
:PATTERN-MATCH:20.1.1.1
:STEP:11
:CMD: show node R2 ip vrf 0 route 0
:STEP:12
:PATTERN-MATCH:30.1.1.1
:STEP:13
:PATTERN-MATCH:40.1.1.1
:STEP:14
:PATTERN-MATCH:50.1.1.2

Delete from most specific to least specific and verify each deletion
:STEP:15
:CMD: config node R2 no rtm-route prefix 192.168.1.1/32 0 0 0 2 5 gateway 50.1.1.2 interface eth8
:STEP:16
:CMD: show node R2 ip vrf 0 route 0
:STEP:17
:PATTERN-NOT-MATCH:192.168.1.1/32
:STEP:18
:PATTERN-MATCH:192.168.1.0/28
:STEP:19
:CMD: config node R2 no rtm-route prefix 192.168.1.0/28 0 0 0 2 30 gateway 40.1.1.1 interface eth7
:STEP:20
:CMD: show node R2 ip vrf 0 route 0
:STEP:21
:PATTERN-NOT-MATCH:192.168.1.0/28
:STEP:22
:PATTERN-MATCH:192.168.1.0/24
:STEP:23
:CMD: config node R2 no rtm-route prefix 192.168.1.0/24 0 0 0 2 20 gateway 30.1.1.1 interface eth4
:STEP:24
:CMD: show node R2 ip vrf 0 route 0
:STEP:25
:PATTERN-NOT-MATCH:192.168.1.0/24
:STEP:26
:PATTERN-MATCH:192.168.0.0/16
:STEP:27
:CMD: config node R2 no rtm-route prefix 192.168.0.0/16 0 0 0 2 10 gateway 20.1.1.1 interface eth3


Verify all overlapping routes are deleted
:STEP:28
:CMD: show node R2 ip vrf 0 route 0
:STEP:29
:PATTERN-NOT-MATCH:192.168.0.0/16
:STEP:30
:PATTERN-NOT-MATCH:192.168.1.0/24
:STEP:31
:PATTERN-NOT-MATCH:192.168.1.0/28
:STEP:32
:PATTERN-NOT-MATCH:192.168.1.1/32

:TESTCASE-END:15


